OL,3,GNEWSAHundreds urged to take up
OL,4,Aunclaimed pension credit
OL,5,
OL,6,FCouncils are contacting more than 700
OL,7,Fhouseholds eligible to receive
OL,8,Fcurrently unclaimed pension credit.
OL,10,FCambridgeshire County Council said the
OL,11,Funclaimed benefits could total up to
OL,12,F#2m.
OL,14,FPension credit tops up your weekly
OL,15,Fincome to #238 if you're single or your
OL,16,Fjoint weekly income to #363.25 if you
OL,17,Fhave a partner. Savings are also taken
OL,18,Finto account.
